# w3id.org/segnaletica-rpe
# Persistent identifiers for the signposts of the hiking trail network catalogued by the
# "Portale Segnaletica Rete Sentieristica" (CAI Regione Piemonte RPE standard).
# Each signpost (palo) carries a QR code pointing to https://w3id.org/segnaletica-rpe/p/<signpost code>,
# for example https://w3id.org/segnaletica-rpe/p/TOS5-0357
#
# Maintainers: see README.md

RewriteEngine on

# Public page of a signpost
RewriteRule ^p/([A-Za-z0-9_-]+)/?$ https://catasto-segnaletica-rpe.ngrok.dev/consulta/palo/$1 [R=302,L]
